  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_accept_1_gil">真的假的？這太讚了！孩子們晚上一定可以大快朵頤！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_art_1_gil">放了一天的甜甜圈！味道也許不怎麼好，但是能拿來買些高級商品，也是不錯的啦。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_art_2_misc">高達 25% 的甜甜圈優惠！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_art_3_misc" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_art_3_misc">優惠 25%，更多的甜甜圈！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_decline_1_gil">來喔吉爾很需要幫幫忙，他們要來拿走我的腎了！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_1_gil">春田市，吉爾北杯有很好吃的點心要給你喔。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_2_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_2_gil">放了一天的甜甜圈！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_3_homer" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_3_homer">嗯，甜甜圈耶。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_4_lisa" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_4_lisa">你不會真的想要吃那些不新鮮的甜甜圈吧？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_5_homer" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_5_homer">不會啊，我會用這些甜甜圈去換來弗林克教授，讓他做一台時光機，然後回到甜甜圈剛出爐的時候，吃新鮮美味的就好。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_accept_1_homer">吉爾，抱歉我之前對你說了那些難聽話。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_2_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_accept_2_gil">喔，別放在心上，下次我回來，你買達夫請我就好了。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_3_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_accept_3_homer">別再回來了。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_art_1_gil">獲得達夫啤酒廠，附贈公司招待「達夫超人」！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_art_2_misc">包括 $50,000、春田市標誌、達夫超人和達夫啤酒廠！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_decline_1_gil">這樣吧，如果你改變心意，可以在「高級物品」選單中找到這個優惠。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_decline_2_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_decline_2_gil">不過就算你買了，我也沒有傭金可以抽。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_1_gil">很好，吉爾，就像預演一樣。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_2_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_2_gil">不好意思，先生…</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_3_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_3_homer">不會吧，又是你！你真是全城最煩人的傢伙了！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_4_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_4_homer">你應該知道大家都很討厭你吧？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_5_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_5_gil">是嗎？為什麼？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_6_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_6_homer">因為你是廣告，我們是人，我們必須做一些逗趣的表演才能賺錢，而你不過就是個廣告罷了。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_7_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_7_gil">喔，哎呀，我想幫我孩子裝矯正器，…是輔助走路的那種，不是牙套。 </str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_8_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_8_homer">呃，好，不管你要賣什麼，我都沒有興趣。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_9_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_9_gil">達夫啤酒廠，附贈達夫超人。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_10_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_10_homer">真的？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_11_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_11_homer">吉爾，你最棒了！我愛你，我愛你，我愛你…</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_frink" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_accept_1_frink">來為科學歡呼吧，呀呼！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_accept_2_kearney" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_accept_2_kearney">閉嘴啊你個臭宅！（毆打）</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_1_gil">誰不希望鎮上都有個麻煩的宅宅？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_2_misc">還能得到些別的東西！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_3_misc" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_3_misc">內含：弗林克實驗室、弗林克教授、$50,000 遊戲幣以及荷馬佛像。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_4_misc" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_4_misc">490 個甜甜圈價格！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_frink" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_decline_1_frink">就是那種對科學毫不在意的態度，我們才會還被重力束縛，到現在還無法登上火星！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_start_1_gil">科學家！叫科學家過來！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_start_2_lisa" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_start_2_lisa">你不能賣掉科學家的創造物，那是只有大學才會做的事。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_start_3_frink" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_start_3_frink">拜託啊，小女孩，我被卡在這個只有我能體會的異界裡好一段時間了。我只想要回來，然後宅在實驗室裡就好。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_icecreamman_" suffix="title" key="promo_icecreamman_title">冰淇淋車</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_hankscorpio" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_accept_1_hankscorpio">吉爾，幹得好。現在去奴役人類，然後你們都到我的礦場工作吧。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_2_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_accept_2_gil">哇，有工作耶！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_art_1_gil">有超大的雷射槍才有資格說出「我是這裡的老大」嘛！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_art_2_misc">內含：火山老巢、邪惡天才漢克和春田市標誌。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_art_3_misc" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_art_3_misc">370 個甜甜圈價格！ </str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_decline_1_gil">來啊！你們難道不想保護自己的城鎮，然後任由那些哥倫比亞人入侵嗎？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_1_gil">哈囉，春田市！你們受夠了有人對你們頤指氣使嗎？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_2_homer" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_2_homer">你說的是誰？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_3_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_3_gil">就是華盛頓那個人啊！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_4_homer" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_4_homer">哪一個華盛頓？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_5_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_5_gil">嗯，現在你們可以對付政府了，把自己的名字寫在山上，然後用死光槍作為保護！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_6_homer" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_6_homer">因為現在有華盛頓州，又有哥倫比亞區……這不是很奇怪嗎？哥倫比亞不是另外一個國家嗎？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_7_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_7_gil">對喔，那還蠻奇怪的。</str>
